t the engine itself. Hosted asset generation and publishing require a Summer account, and generation/paid builds consume credits. Gemini is a legacy setup target alongside current Antigravity guidance. No install or end-to-end compatibility test was performed here. This is not a Google-provided integration.","limitations","What the source actually contains","CLI/MCP integration source, not the engine source. Verified src/mcp/server.ts, src/cli/commands/setup.ts, src/installer/setup.ts, gemini-extension.json, integrations/gemini/README.md, scripts/build-gemini-extension.ts, and library/skills/. The Gemini packaging document explains the actual extension skills layout rather than assuming an arbitrary manifest skills key works.","codeScope","Code type","Implementation","codeType","links","Evidence","items",[79],"evidenceUrl",{"_50":75,"_25":80},"https://github.com/summerengine/summer/blob/main/integrations/gemini/README.md","Code / instructions",[84],"codeUrl",{"_50":81,"_25":85},"https://github.com/summerengine/summer/blob/main/src/mcp/server.ts","Primary source",[89],"sourceUrl",{"_50":86,"_25":90},"https://github.com/summerengine/summer","Engine / runtime","Summer Engine","engine","list","Attributed clients / models","ordered",false,[100,101,102,103,104,105,106],"agents","Gemini CLI","Antigravity","Codex","Claude Code","Cursor","GitHub Copilot","OpenCode","Toolkit category","Engine bridges","lead","summary","bridge",[114,115,116,117,118,119,120],"implementation","gemini-cli","antigravity","codex","claude-code","cursor","copilot","opencode",{"_122":123},"documents",{"_124":125,"_126":127},"en",[129,133,134,135,132,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,131,168,130,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189],"zh",[128,129,130,131,132],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-